{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40692","headline":"龙池春草 · 李洞","name":"龙池春草","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙池清禁里，芳草傍池春。\n旋长方遮岸，全生不染尘。\n和风轻动色，湛露静流津。\n浅得承天步，深疑遶御轮。\n鱼寻倒影没，花带湿光新。\n肯学长河畔，绵绵思远人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}